  "item": [
    {
      "id": "cd03a219-d6a8-4a8d-9b17-243d5917ad0c",
      "name": "Beta Endpoints",
      "description": {
        "content": "### What is it?\n\nBeta endpoints are early-access versions of the upcoming v2 API that provide developers with a preview of new features and changes before the official v2 release. These endpoints are accessible at `api.aweber.com/2.0-beta/` and include **new functionality not available in v1**.\n\nBeta endpoints are previews of v2 functionality and do not replace v1 endpoints. The stable v1 API remains the recommended choice for production applications.\n\n### Important Notice\n\n**Beta endpoints are experimental and subject to change without notice.** As beta endpoints, developers should expect:\n\n- **Contracts may change** at any time without backward compatibility\n- **Endpoints may not follow** previously established patterns from v1 endpoints\n- **Current Documentation may be inaccurate** or incomplete\n- **Limited support** compared to stable v1 endpoints\n- **No guarantee of stability** until official v2 release\n\n**Use beta endpoints only for testing and development purposes.** Do not rely on beta endpoints for production applications.\n\n### Key Differences from v1 API\n\nBeta endpoints introduce several changes that preview the upcoming v2 API:\n\n- **UUID Identifiers**: Resources use UUIDs instead of numeric IDs\n- **New Functionality**: Access to capabilities and data not available through v1 endpoints\n- **Different Base URL**: Beta endpoints are accessible at `api.aweber.com/2.0-beta/` instead of `api.aweber.com/1.0/`\n\n### Authentication\n\nBeta endpoints use the same OAuth 2.0 authentication as v1 endpoints. Your existing access tokens and authentication flow will work with beta endpoints.\n\n### Base URL\n\n```\nhttps://api.aweber.com/2.0-beta/\n```\n\n### Support\n\nFor questions about beta endpoints:\n- Email: [api@aweber.com](mailto:api@aweber.com?subject=Beta%20Endpoints)\n- Include \"Beta Endpoints\" in your subject line\n- Provide specific details about the endpoint and issue encountered\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "04840031-f0d1-4abc-b67e-78286a3b1218",
          "name": "Broadcast Links Analytics",
          "request": {
            "name": "Broadcast Links Analytics",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns links data for clicks or pageviews in a broadcast. The data can be filtered by minimum and maximum unique counts.\nThis endpoint is part of the beta 2.0 API and uses UUID identifiers.\n**This is a beta endpoint and is subject to change without notice.** Use only for testing and development purposes.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "2.0-beta",
                "analytics",
                "reports",
                "broadcasts-links"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "account_id",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Account UUID. Can be found using the [Get accounts](#tag/Accounts/paths/~1accounts/get) endpoint."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "broadcast_id",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Broadcast UUID. Can be found using the [Get broadcasts](#tag/Broadcasts/paths/~1accounts~1{accountId}~1lists~1{listId}~1broadcasts/get) endpoint."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "filter",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Type of link data to retrieve"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "min_count",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Minimum count threshold for unique links"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "max_count",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "Maximum count threshold for unique links"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "sort_by",
                  "value": "unique",
                  "description": "Field to sort the results by"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "sort_asc",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": "Whether to sort in ascending order (true) or descending order (false)"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "before",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "specifies the IDs for pagination, for results from before onward"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "after",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "specifies the IDs for pagination, for results from after onward"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "specifies the max number of items in a single page"
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                {
                  "key": "scope",
                  "value": "account.read landing-page.read list.read list.write subscriber.read subscriber.write subscriber.read-extended email.read email.write"
                },
                {
                  "key": "redirect_uri",
                  "value": "https://auth.aweber.com/oauth2/token"
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessTokenUrl",
                  "value": "https://auth.aweber.com/oauth2/token"
                },
                {
                  "key": "authUrl",
                  "value": "https://auth.aweber.com/oauth2/authorize"
                },
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "authorization_code"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
